              "text": "શું તે બેભાન થયો? — śũ te bebhān thayo? — \"Did he faint?\""
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Word for word, to become senseless: બેભાન, bebhān, and થવું, thavũ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "બેભાન થવું (bebhān thavũ) is built from bebhān, \"senseless\", and thavũ, \"to become\". Bebhān is usually explained as the Persian prefix be-, \"without\", joined to bhān, \"awareness\", usually traced to Sanskrit bhāna, \"appearance\" (CDIAL 9451); CDIAL lists no Gujarati form of the whole."
            }
          ]
        },
